## Global Rules (Apply to Every Change)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Before touching any file, confirm these rules are followed:
> - **NEVER** hardcode hex colors — always use `AppColors.X`
> - **NEVER** use `.withOpacity()` — always `.withValues(alpha: X)`
> - **NEVER** use `print()` — always `debugPrint()`
> - **NEVER** recreate existing services — extend `FirestoreService.instance`, `AuthService.instance`, `FavoritesService.instance`
> - Images = base64 data URIs in Firestore (NOT Storage URLs, unless explicit)
> - All Firebase calls wrapped in `try/catch` with `if (mounted)` guards
> - Use `const` constructors wherever possible

