- `bookings/{bookingId}` — read/create/cancel-update by owner only
- `parkingLots/{lotId}` — read by auth users; write via Cloud Functions only
- `parkingLots/{lotId}/slots/{slotId}` — read by auth users; write via transaction only
- `reviews/{reviewId}` — read by auth; create by owner
- `transactions/{txId}` — read by owner; write via Cloud Functions only
- `wallets/{userId}` — read by owner; write via Cloud Functions only
- `notifications/{notifId}` — read by owner; update only `isRead` field

